  "_doc": "Rohan beyond Edoras and Helm's Deep, the country the Rohirrim came from, and the ruined North — Arnor, Angmar, the Barrow-downs and the ice at the top of the map. Most of this is background in the books and half of it is a footnote in the Appendices, which is exactly why it is worth visiting.",
